      Toy values, not project results; every row was also reproduced in R. Set the widget to any row
      to compare.
    </p>
  </Container>

  <!-- ============================================================= Status -->
  <Container>
    <h1>Status</h1>
    <p class="text">
      The paper is in preparation. Results are held back pending submission, together with the code,
